  "content": "<p>此版本的燧發槍模組已整合進 Create（和 Create Crafts &amp; Additions）中，旨在讓製作與升級更貼近現實且更平衡</p><p>此版本的燧發槍模組已整合進&nbsp;</p><p>另外，我製作的材質包可從<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/muskets-reworked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>下載檢視</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\">改動內容：</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;-調整材質以反映新的合成配方</p><p>&nbsp;-修改合成配方，使用 Create / Create Crafts &amp; Additions 的物品</p><p>&nbsp;-從戰利品表中移除鍛造模板，並以工作台合成配方取代</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\">需求模組：</span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/createaddition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Crafts&amp;Additions</a></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>請勿安裝原版的</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>燧發槍模組，否則會衝突</strong></span></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#e03e2d\">合成配方：</span></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 燧發槍配方：</p><h1>&nbsp;&nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1095481/description_a5e07465-ca74-41cf-9609-510d18ea96ca.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"148\"></h1><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 燧發手槍配方：</p><h1>&nbsp;&nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1095481/description_7e72ba1e-126b-4ec5-bc12-727e73c57728.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"293\" height=\"148\"></h1><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 大口徑短槍配方：</p><h1>&nbsp;&nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1095481/description_72bb362d-d70e-48ad-8d4f-98dd1dbee914.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"299\" height=\"148\"></h1><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 配件配方：</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1095481/description_c7b6daa8-f85d-4d85-9aa7-08b236277f5d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"294\" height=\"148\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1095481/description_fa3afd11-4ae5-4136-b68a-62400f04bbdf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"294\" height=\"148\"></p><p>我並未製作此模組，所有功勞歸於 ewewukek</p>",
